+*   **Multiplicity:** Each voxel in a $3 \times 3 \times 3$ brick is shared with up to 8 neighboring bricks, requiring inverse multiplicity weighting [S1].
 
 **Parameters:**
-*   **Kernel:** 3x3x3 Gaussian weighting kernel. This is considered an optimal reconstruction filter [FP02].
-*   **Levels:** $n-1$ filtering steps for an octree of $n$ levels.
